Description: Impacket SMBExec Artifacts
Author: Paul CABON CERT Almond
Version: 1.0
Id: f171a1d9-5f47-40f6-8143-d9787de560a9
RecreateDirectories: true
Targets:
    -
        Name: SMBExec Output File
        Category: LateralMovement
        Path: C:\__output
        Comment: "Command output file created by Impacket smbexec.py. Persists when the tool crashes before cleanup."
    -
        Name: SMBExec Batch File
        Category: LateralMovement
        Path: %systemroot%\Temp\execute.bat
        Comment: "Batch file written by Impacket smbexec.py containing the attacker's command. Persists when the tool crashes before cleanup."

# Documentation
# https://u0041.co/posts/articals/smbexec-analysis/
